cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AquaScope in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: AquaScope
abstract: >-
  AquaScope Hydrology combines a browser river-data Explorer with Python tools
  for checking observation coverage, analyzing water records and exporting
  reproducible results. Agency coverage and method suitability vary by task.
authors:
  - family-names: Ouédraogo
